<title>USA: ATHLETICS-U.S. CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-U.S. CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
